# Dependencies

Use packages already in `pubspec.yaml`. Do not add alternate stacks for the same concern.

## Categories (installed)

| Category | Packages | Usage |
|----------|----------|--------|
| State | `flutter_bloc`, `equatable` | Cubit + Equatable states |
| DI | `get_it` | `sl` / feature `init*` |
| Nav | `go_router` | `app_router.dart` |
| Network | `dio`, `internet_connection_checker_plus` | `ApiConsumer` / `NetworkInfo` |
| FP errors | `dartz` | `Either` |
| Storage | `hive`, `hive_flutter`, `shared_preferences`, `flutter_secure_storage` | cache / prefs / tokens |
| UI | `flutter_screenutil`, `shimmer`, `cached_network_image`, `cupertino_icons` | sizing / placeholders / images |
| i18n | `easy_localization`, `intl` | translations |
| Config | `envied`, `flutter_flavor` | env + flavors |
| Logging | `logger` | app logger |
| Splash/icons | `flutter_native_splash`, `flutter_launcher_icons` | native assets |
| Codegen (dev) | `build_runner`, `envied_generator`, `hive_generator`, `flutter_lints` | generate + lint |

## Preferred patterns

- Networking only through `ApiConsumer`, not ad-hoc `Dio()` in features.
- Localization only through easy_localization / `LocaleKeys`.
- DI only through GetIt — no injectable annotations.

## Do not add without explicit user request

Riverpod, Provider, GetX, auto_route, Freezed, json_serializable, retrofit, Firebase packages.

## Note

`CancelableSafeCubitMixin` uses `package:async` transitively; if you import it directly, add `async` to `pubspec.yaml` dependencies (analyzer currently ignores `depend_on_referenced_packages`).
